        <em>Immunolyser 2.0: An advanced computational pipeline for comprehensive
        analysis of immunopeptidomic data.</em>
        Comput Struct Biotechnol J. 2025;29:296&ndash;304.
        doi:<a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.csbj.2025.10.007" target="_blank" rel="noopener">10.1016/j.csbj.2025.10.007</a>.
      </p>
      <p class="cite-text" style="margin-top:.4rem;">
